<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Top 20 Australian Dividend Yields - Oct 8.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Top 20 Australian Dividend Yields - Oct 8.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-10-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Twenty highest dividend yields for Australian companies included in the 320-share All Ordinaries Index based on closing prices on October 7.</p>
<p>Dividends based on rolling 12 months.</p>
<p>Yields are not grossed up for franking credits.</p>
<p>				Dividend</p>
<p>Rank Name		   Yield     Close</p>
<p>1  McIntosh Sec	    10.23     0.88</p>
<p>2  Prime Credit Tr	 10.21     0.96</p>
<p>3  Indu Property	   10.11     0.90</p>
<p>4  Prop Income Inv	 10.06     1.01</p>
<p>5  Villa World		9.57     1.15</p>
<p>6  BT Prop Trust	    9.49     1.72</p>
<p>7  Colonial Mutual	  9.12     1.16</p>
<p>8  Central Equity	   8.91     1.01</p>
<p>9  Aust Tour		  8.82     0.85</p>
<p>10 Gandel Retail Tr	 8.76     0.89</p>
<p>11 Centro Prop		8.71     2.24</p>
<p>12 Armstrong Retail	 8.68     0.76</p>
<p>13 Advance Pro CB	   8.47     1.37</p>
<p>14 Equitilink		 8.47     0.59</p>
<p>15 Nth Building Soc	 8.46     2.72</p>
